---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Consulting" description="One free evaluation, then consulting at CAD $100 per hour, up to three hours per week per client, or a separately defined contract with Cognis 11 Inc.">
  <PageHeading number="02" label="Consulting" title="Begin with the question." description="For consulting inquiries related to synthetic intelligence and computational architectures, start a conversation with the founder." />
  <div class="shell page-body">
    <section class="editorial-block" aria-labelledby="consulting-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Consulting inquiries</p>
      <div><h2 id="consulting-heading">Bring a specific problem.</h2><p>Begin with a problem that deserves close examination, a mechanism you want to understand, or an assumption you are prepared to question.</p><p>Tell the founder what you are building, what is blocking you, what you have already tried, and what a useful result would look like. Start with one free evaluation, then agree on the work together.</p><h3>Human judgment. AI-assisted work.</h3><p>AI tools are part of the working method: exploration, drafting, and prototyping alongside human review. The engagement is with the operator who frames the problem, examines the output, and makes the technical decisions.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="consulting-offer" aria-labelledby="offer-heading">
      <div class="offer-intro"><p class="eyebrow">An independent practice</p><h2 id="offer-heading">A clear arrangement.</h2><p>Consulting supports an independent research practice. The weekly limit reserves time for developing Cognis 11’s own technology.</p></div>
      <div class="offer-terms">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Start here</p><h3>One free evaluation.</h3><p>Describe the question and establish whether there is a useful fit before committing to paid work.</p></div>
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Hourly consulting</p><h3><span class="offer-rate">CAD $100</span> <span class="offer-unit">/ hour</span></h3><p><strong>Up to 3 hours per week per client.</strong> Scope and availability are confirmed before work begins.</p></div>
        <div><p class="eyebrow">The clock &amp; focused work</p><h3>The work starts with your documentation.</h3><p>After the free evaluation and agreement to a paid engagement, time spent reviewing your documentation is billable. Review, analysis, preparation, agreed execution, meetings, and client-requested interruptions during that work all count toward the same weekly cap.</p><p>Send complete material together and consolidate follow-up questions. Protecting focused work protects the time available for your problem.</p></div>
        <div><p class="eyebrow">A separate agreement</p><h3>A contract defined together.</h3><p>A contract can be arranged separately, with its scope, schedule, and fee agreed before work begins. Reserved availability or exclusivity would also need a separate agreement.</p></div>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href={sitePath('contact/')}>Request a free evaluation <Arrow diagonal /></a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <a class="text-link" href={sitePath('research/')}>Explore the research direction <Arrow /></a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
